# Three Points requests, one per tests/pointscount_test.cpp check: a
# 6-float "P" (two points), a "P"-less request carrying a 3-float "Cs" (a
# multiple-of-three parameter under a different name), and a 4-float "P"
# (not a multiple of three). A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB
# authoring" section, "The desync convention."
Display "pointscount.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 16 16 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [30]
WorldBegin
Points "P" [0 0 0  1 1 1]
Points "Cs" [1 0 0]
Points "P" [0 0 0  1]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
